- Không thể chứa các hàm gom nhóm (Aggregate functions như SUM, AVG, COUNT, MAX, MIN).
• Mệnh đề HAVING:
- Được dùng để lọc các nhóm (groups) sau khi đã gom nhóm bằng GROUP BY.
- Thường xuyên kết hợp và chứa các hàm gom nhóm.
➜ Ví dụ: Lọc các phòng ban có lương trung bình > 10 triệu:
SELECT MaPhong, AVG(Luong) FROM NhanVien GROUP BY MaPhong HAVING AVG(Luong) > 10000000;
Câu 5: Chuẩn hóa dữ liệu (Normalization) là gì? Nêu định nghĩa Dạng chuẩn 1 (1NF), 2 (2NF) và 3 (3NF).
Lời giải:
Chuẩn hóa dữ liệu là quá trình phân tích và tổ chức các bảng trong CSDL nhằm giảm thiểu sự dư thừa dữ liệu và tránh các bất thường (Anomalies) khi thêm, sửa, xóa.
• 1NF (Dạng chuẩn 1): Các giá trị trong mỗi cột phải là đơn trị (atomic), không chứa danh sách hoặc tập hợp giá trị.
• 2NF (Dạng chuẩn 2): Đã đạt 1NF và mọi thuộc tính không phải khóa phải phụ thuộc thuộc tính vào toàn bộ khóa chính', '[-0.03346797,0.01279064,0.01970754,-0.02382233,-0.06282227,0.06032056,0.08970288,0.04831416,0.05526848,0.01634163,0.09440879,-0.1232023,-0.0166298,-0.0742543,-0.07507111,-0.03457916,-0.04709292,0.04504796,-0.06848238,-0.08006661,-0.0321995,-0.00938049,0.00102479,-0.00781962,-0.00623812,0.00424567,-0.03541934,0.11907832,0.08312686,-0.11996846,-0.03993459,0.16194488,0.10348687,-0.01066692,0.00435717,0.00868824,0.00655272,-0.12695308,0.02550843,0.03032617,-0.02862123,0.02092983,0.01582145,-0.07409372,0.05763083,0.04958518,-0.05086579,-0.0030563,-0.06928097,0.04232546,-0.03232354,0.11016061,-0.04316466,0.11289816,0.01401725,-0.01880308,-0.0727291,-0.03809571,-0.03326313,-0.06927773,-0.05272118,0.04221895,-0.04365692,0.00923275,-0.00568666,-0.02618855,0.00810514,0.03235267,-0.03178022,0.08500125,-0.0117396,-0.0592797,-0.04178483,0.04354418,-0.0596849,0.01906971,-0.0587045,-0.01862621,0.07095584,-0.09203494,0.00872288,0.09038141,0.07679795,-0.08473503,-0.00596316,0.04138241,0.00281157,0.0088598,0.00640763,-0.0781171,-0.02179754,0.05305654,0.05816945,-0.00918379,-0.05633038,-0.05690821,0.03540578,0.00812899,0.04841047,0.0614858,0.06268127,0.08654155,0.00580429,-0.09673854,-0.08025862,0.01007756,0.02411235,0.03667539,0.02375265,0.06147128,-0.09843031,0.04879942,-0.02977122,-0.12456435,-0.02929205,-0.00827081,0.03318403,-0.04270814,-0.04207611,-0.05401311,0.04175952,-0.05584459,-0.00654378,0.0205918,0.01321095,-0.04119251,0.04502464,0,0.013265,-0.09200829,0.05841006,-0.07210985,0.02446751,-0.0073624,-0.01656894,0.00816332,-0.06340192,0.00609001,-0.05373934,0.0311989,-0.05006976,-0.02911832,0.04299265,0.01672857,-0.00219879,-0.07432096,-0.00414289,-0.0256726,0.04200827,-0.00281208,0.0454179,0.04242245,0.06046111,-0.01742527,-0.04291647,-0.05510033,-0.02205877,0.02766987,0.04549631,-0.01166224,-0.0787674,-0.04690297,-0.14267899,0.00533692,-0.01347091,-0.009963