- Tối ưu cho dữ liệu lớn (Big Data) và truy vấn tốc độ cao, mở rộng theo chiều ngang (Horizontal Scaling).
- Ví dụ: MongoDB, Redis, Cassandra, Neo4j.
Câu 10: Viết câu lệnh SQL tìm Nhân viên có lương cao thứ nhì trong bảng `NhanVien`.
Lời giải:
Có hai cách phổ biến để giải bài toán này:
Cách 1: Sử dụng truy vấn con (Subquery):
SELECT MAX(Luong) AS LuongCaoThuNhi
FROM NhanVien
WHERE Luong < (SELECT MAX(Luong) FROM NhanVien);
Cách 2: Sử dụng LIMIT và OFFSET (Áp dụng cho MySQL / PostgreSQL):
SELECT DISTINCT Luong
FROM NhanVien
ORDER BY Luong DESC
LIMIT 1 OFFSET 1;', '[-0.06840324,0.02678138,-0.03367526,-0.02735799,-0.06075113,-0.03213912,-0.01149302,0.0529627,-0.00196217,0.02881076,0.0902114,-0.0691883,-0.00588968,-0.02705363,-0.06667108,0.01963419,-0.04499762,0.00995816,-0.08392856,-0.00572788,-0.02669158,-0.02253499,-0.05890319,0.04637881,0.01444052,-0.02214251,-0.0182424,0.041148,0.04221266,-0.08709755,-0.01246789,0.17554668,0.005233,0.01338609,0.0090533,0.03541153,0.02450119,-0.08052523,0.00510801,-0.00456332,0.01559915,-0.03028032,0.0033487,-0.0421597,0.08276736,-0.03727824,-0.10065329,0.0362696,-0.04697082,0.02675897,-0.11689779,0.0508539,-0.03743931,0.11995,0.01539891,0.00175384,-0.01890776,0.03296807,-0.01289071,-0.0526878,-0.00291544,0.03443222,0.00080433,0.04080198,0.00941898,0.00929322,-0.01469959,-0.06020714,-0.0294772,0.03567873,0.0160925,-0.02907504,-0.06925989,0.04136091,-0.01340873,0.01222754,-0.02445047,-0.01978121,0.03954976,-0.07059731,-0.01756404,0.06943208,0.03565465,-0.04188537,-0.05704816,0.00649339,-0.01296583,-0.0767222,-0.03078946,-0.08927227,0.03641694,0.04255599,0.0192679,0.01365614,-0.1147465,-0.04514607,0.00101435,-0.02853657,0.06475612,0.03430723,0.06922272,0.07972553,0.02341395,-0.00418511,-0.07594864,0.00616509,0.03955404,-0.01036568,0.03873529,-0.00556093,-0.00391304,0.03937467,-0.03596367,-0.1296266,0.00177302,0.00902351,-0.10202077,-0.06086046,-0.05298851,-0.03039114,0.02048091,-0.02586918,-0.0892897,-0.02172417,-0.01924748,-0.0259637,0.0122667,0,0.03967463,-0.03677095,0.10650814,-0.08593542,0.0150829,-0.00859763,-0.0724218,-0.02519463,-0.14964132,0.01450586,-0.05295468,0.11641,-0.07914237,0.00502532,0.10216352,-0.00103276,0.07442544,-0.01365369,-0.00443601,-0.01030882,0.09558284,0.00584954,-0.02155935,0.02293239,0.09719752,0.02303487,-0.02875757,-0.01807649,-0.04925003,0.04025593,0.001604,-0.04571843,-0.06479242,0.00949752,-0.06718559,-0.02607092,-0.06619798,-0.03215674,-0.00676691,-0.01791028,0.09143711,0.06612524,-0.03339388,-0.03356333,0.01602745,0.10490368,0.04695446,